// How the screens reach the service: the call as its dialect serves it, and
// for an operation that travels in a handshake's envelope, the handshake and
// the envelope (ADR-145, ADR-161, ADR-164). The standard dialect is the
// operation's own method and path. The dxlib dialect is a POST at
// /<operationId> with every parameter in one JSON body, and its one
